<title>USA: State of Washington to sell $125 mln GOs on 7/23.</title>
<headline>State of Washington to sell $125 mln GOs on 7/23.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State of Washington plans to sell through competitive auction $125 million of general obligation refunding bonds for various purposes on July 23.</p>
<p>The sale is slated for 1130 EDT. The financial adviser is Seattle Northwest. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
